## ScummVM engine

This project distributes a build of the **ScummVM** engine (the SCUMM/HE
interpreter compiled to WebAssembly), located in `web/vendor/` and
`web/data/`. ScummVM is open source under the **GNU General Public License
version 3**; the full text is in `web/vendor/COPYING`.
Upstream: https://scummvm.org / https://github.com/scummvm/scummvm

## Game content — not included

This repository does **not** contain any Spy Fox in Dry Cereal game content.
The game's original resources are not distributed here. To play, you must
supply a disc image of a copy of the game you are entitled to use, and you are
solely responsible for having the right to use that copy. The original game
assets remain the property of their respective rights holders.
